<title>POLAND: Polish WIG index seen at 19,243 at year-end.</title>
<headline>Polish WIG index seen at 19,243 at year-end.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brokerages see the Warsaw bourse's main WIG index rising to 19,243 points at the end of this year and to 20,825 at mid-1998, a monthly poll conducted by financial daily Dziennik Prawa i Gospodarki showed.</p>
<p>Last month the brokerages saw the WIG index at 19,067 points at the end of this year.</p>
<p>The WIG index closed at 16,382.3 points on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
